      ]
    },
    {
      "contradiction_count": 0,
      "future_rule": "Invalidate a short-rate position on that contract's own path. If the forward falls and the strip is not pricing hikes, the hiking-cycle thesis is finished even when Brent is still in the low 90s. Do not pay Australian bills when the front is 5.00 and the back is 4.88.",
